# Campaign scratch: per-phase stdout, benchmark probes, shell shims. The
# scientific record is results/logs, results/tables and results/_campaign.
results/_campaign_logs/

# Colab campaign output. campaign_results/ is the live campaign tree (usually a
# Drive-backed directory that <repo>/results symlinks to); expected_results/ is
# generated from colab/campaign_inventory.py and IS tracked, because it is the
# structure contract the campaign is validated against.
campaign_results/
results/_campaign/colab/
colab/__pycache__/
